+/*
+ * GetOpenFileName and GetSaveFileName through the item dialog
+ *
+ * Like Windows since Vista, calls that do not customize the dialog with a
+ * hook or a template get the item (IFileDialog) dialog instead of the
+ * Explorer style one. The OPENFILENAME fields are mapped to the dialog and
+ * the result is written back the way the Explorer style dialog does it.
+ * HKCU\Software\Wine\FileDialog "Classic"=1 (also per application under
+ * AppDefaults\<exe>\FileDialog) keeps the old dialog.
